起源宠物有独特的协同进化机制，完成协同进化可以提升起源宠物的星级和解锁其他周边系:
Origin Pokémons have a unique co-evolution mechanism, completing co-evolution can improve the star level of origin Pokémons and unlock other peripheral systems. 
 Synergistic evolution: 
1) Origin Pokémons have 3 synergistic Pokémon slots, players need to fill the Supreme or Mythic of ordinary Pokémons to carry out synergistic evolution; 
2) ordinary Pokémons can only participate in one of the origin Pokémons to synergize, can not synergize more than one origin Pokémon at the same time; 
3) after completing the synergy by the synergistic effect of the origin Pokémons will be based on the synergistic Pokémon star, equipment, plate, exclusive trinket. The specific rules are as follows: 
 1. Star: the initial star of all origin Pokémons is 5 stars, and when the synergy is completed, the star will become the average star of the synergistic Pokémons. If all 3 Pokémons in the synergy are Mythic, they will receive an additional 8% bonus to their attributes; 
 2. Plate: unlocked when the origin Pokémon reaches 6 stars, the level of the plate is equal to the average of all the synergistic Pokémons' plate levels; 
 3. Trinket: unlocked when the origin Pokémon reaches 7 stars, the level of the trinket is equal to the average of the trinket levels of all the synergistic Pokémons; 
 4. Potential development: unlocked when the origin Pokémon reaches 7 stars, players need to develop the potential bonuses that need to be enhanced; 
 5. Equipment: divided into ordinary equipment and advanced equipment, calculated by the average equipment level of the respective parts of the synergistic Pokémons. When all synergistic Pokémons are all senior equipment in a certain part, the synergistic Pokémon's equipment becomes senior equipment of his profession, and the reinforcement level will be calculated equally; 
 6. Orb: synergistic Pokémons are assembled full of red orb, and the level of the Orb are to reach 3 levels to unlock, unlock the origin of the Pokémon need players to choose their own orb inlay; 
 7. Berries: synergistic Pokémons to carry orange berries, both need to be raised to 3 stars and breakthrough +4 and cultivation progress are required to reach 70% to unlock, unlock the origin of the Pokémon need to choose their own berries to carry; 
 8. Soul heart: synergistic Pokémons are assembled soul heart equipment, and all red soul heart and star level 3 will be unlocked, after unlocking the origin of the Pokémon requires players to choose their own soul heart for assembly.

